cff-version: 1.2.0
title: >-
  From logistic regression to deep learning: machine learning
  modeling of lightning in ERA5 reanalysis data
message: >-
  If you use this software or the data samples in this
  repository, please cite the associated paper below. Note
  that channel 6 of the data samples derives from Met Office
  ATDnet data released under CC-BY-SA 4.0; derivative work
  including that channel must comply with those terms.
type: software
abstract: >-
  Code, trained models and sample data for a study modeling
  lightning occurrence over Europe from ERA5 reanalysis. A
  deep convolutional neural network (U-Net) that processes
  surrounding grid cells is compared against local
  single-grid-cell models — logistic regression, generalized
  additive model, extreme gradient boosting and multi-layer
  perceptron — using 13 years of data and leave-one-year-out
  cross-validation.
